{"ref":"BDB, נָדָב","hw":"נָדָב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נָדָב</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>generous, noble</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  eldest son of Aaron <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:23\" href=\"/Exodus.6.23\">Ex 6:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:1\" href=\"/Exodus.24.1\">24:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 24:9\" href=\"/Exodus.24.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:1\" href=\"/Exodus.28.1\">28:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 10:1\" href=\"/Leviticus.10.1\">Lv 10:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:2\" href=\"/Numbers.3.2\">Nu 3:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:4\" href=\"/Numbers.3.4\">4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:60\" href=\"/Numbers.26.60\">26:60</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:61\" href=\"/Numbers.26.61\">61</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.29\">1 Ch 5:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:1\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.1\">24:1</a>. 𝔊 Ναδαβ (so <strong>3, 4</strong>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  son of Jeroboam I <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.20\">1 K 14:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.25\">15:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:27\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.27\">27</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.31\">31</a>. 𝔊 Ναβατ, Ναβαθ, 𝔊L Ναδαβ.<br><strong>3.</strong>  a Jerahmeelite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:28\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.28\">1 Ch 2:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.30\">30</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  a Gibeonite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.30\">1 Ch 8:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:36\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.36\">9:36</a>.","next":"BDB, נְדָבָה","prev":"BDB, נָדַב"}